    response: "I have completed the UI design and style overhaul across the entire application:\n\n- **Dual-Theme Visual Architecture**: Implemented full support for both Dark Mode and Light Mode with a theme switcher in the navigation bar, providing high-contrast text legibility, refined borders, and unified color tokens.\n- **Typographic Hierarchy & Polish**: Paired **Plus Jakarta Sans** for body copy and headings with **JetBrains Mono** for metric scores, execution telemetry, and memory node IDs.\n- **Redesigned Component Suite**:\n  - **Navigation & Brand Bar**: Streamlined header with quick profile previews, active route indicators, badge counters, and theme toggling.\n  - **Judge Demo Controller**: Enhanced quick-start presets for 2-session demonstration scenarios and memory persistence verification.\n  - **Agent Execution Pipeline**: Redesigned step-by-step reasoning progress view with state badges, execution timing metrics, and animated status indicators.\n  - **Opportunity Fit Cards**: Clear 5-factor scoring breakdowns with skill overlap badges and direct application links.\n  - **Skill Gap Diagnostics & Action Plan**: Milestone-based progress tracking with difficulty ratings and learning resource recommendations.\n  - **Memory Bank & Profile Management**: Interactive preference manager and application pipeline boards styled with consistent card spacing and responsive layouts."
    modified_response: "I have completed the UI design and style overhaul across the entire application:\n\n- **Dual-Theme Visual Architecture**: Implemented full support for both Dark Mode and Light Mode with a theme switcher in the navigation bar, providing high-contrast text legibility, refined borders, and unified color tokens.\n- **Typographic Hierarchy & Polish**: Paired **Plus Jakarta Sans** for body copy and headings with **JetBrains Mono** for metric scores, execution telemetry, and memory node IDs.\n- **Redesigned Component Suite**:\n  - **Navigation & Brand Bar**: Streamlined header with quick profile previews, active route indicators, badge counters, and theme toggling.\n  - **Judge Demo Controller**: Enhanced quick-start presets for 2-session demonstration scenarios and memory persistence verification.\n  - **Agent Execution Pipeline**: Redesigned step-by-step reasoning progress view with state badges, execution timing metrics, and animated status indicators.\n  - **Opportunity Fit Cards**: Clear 5-factor scoring breakdowns with skill overlap badges and direct application links.\n  - **Skill Gap Diagnostics & Action Plan**: Milestone-based progress tracking with difficulty ratings and learning resource recommendations.\n  - **Memory Bank & Profile Management**: Interactive preference manager and application pipeline boards styled with consistent card spacing and responsive layouts."
