estion again!\",\n        suggestedQuestions: [\n          \'How do I prepare for AI/ML interviews?\',\n          \'What projects should I build for my resume?\',\n          \'What are top summer internships for 3rd year students?\'\n        ]\n      });\n    }\n  });\n\n  // Agent Execution Endpoints"
