  planner_response {
    response: "I have added **Agent Nova**, an AI Career Intelligence & Opportunity Mentor chatbot, to the application.\n\n### Key Capabilities & Implementation:\n\n1. **Context-Aware Career Chat Engine (`/api/agent/chat`)**:\n   - **Personalized Context Integration**: Automatically retrieves and reasons over the student\'s profile (*degree, branch, year, current skills, career interests, target location*), persistent preferences from the Memory Bank, and verified opportunities in the database.\n   - **Tactical Guidance**: Answers complex queries on AI/ML roadmaps, high-impact resume projects using the XYZ formula, technical interview preparation blueprints, and research fellowship outreach.\n   - **Multi-Tier AI Resilience**: Implements seamless fallback handling between primary and fast models, with fallback knowledge synthesis during network demand spikes.\n\n2. **Dedicated Agent Nova Hub**:\n   - **Interactive Starter Topics**: Provides one-click starting prompts across *Career Strategy, Resume & Portfolio, Interview Prep,* and *Research & Labs*.\n   - **Rich Markdown Formatting**: Formats advice with bold headings, clean bulleted steps, code blocks, and copy-to-clipboard actions.\n   - **Interactive Follow-up Chips**: Automatically provides 3 contextual follow-up questions at the end of each response that can be clicked to continue the conversation.\n   - **1-Click Opportunity Alignment**: Allows students to launch live opportunity matching directly from Agent Nova\'s recommendations.\n\n3. **Floating Quick-Assistant Widget**:\n   - Added a floating **\"Ask Agent Nova\"** assistant button in the bottom-right corner, allowing students to ask quick career questions from any view (*Agent Hub, Profile & Skills, Opportunities, Memory Bank*) without losing their place, with an option to expand into the full chat view."
    modified_response: "I have added **Agent Nova**, an AI Career Intelligence & Opportunity Mentor chatbot, to the application.\n\n### Key Capabilities & Implementation:\n\n1. **Context-Aware Career Chat Engine (`/api/agent/chat`)**:\n   - **Personalized Context Integration**: Automatically retrieves and reasons over the student\'s profile (*degree, branch, year, current skills, career interests, target location*), persistent preferences from the Memory Bank, and verified opportunities in the database.\n   - **Tactical Guidance**: Answers complex queries on AI/ML roadmaps, high-impact resume projects using the XYZ formula, technical interview preparation blueprints, and research fellowship outreach.\n   - **Multi-Tier AI Resilience**: Implements seamless fallback handling between primary and fast models, with fallback knowledge synthesis during network demand spikes.\n\n2. **Dedicated Agent Nova Hub**:\n   - **Interactive Starter Topics**: Provides one-click starting prompts across *Career Strategy, Resume & Portfolio, Interview Prep,* and *Research & Labs*.\n   - **Rich Markdown Formatting**: Formats advice with bold headings, clean bulleted steps, code blocks, and copy-to-clipboard actions.\n   - **Interactive Follow-up Chips**: Automatically provides 3 contextual follow-up questions at the end of each response that can be clicked to continue the conversation.\n   - **1-Click Opportunity Alignment**: Allows students to launch live opportunity matching directly from Agent Nova\'s recommendations.\n\n3. **Floating Quick-Assistant Widget**:\n   - Added a floating **\"Ask Agent Nova\"** assistant button in the bottom-right corner, allowing students to ask quick career questions from any view (*Agent Hub, Profile & Skills, Opportunities, Memory Bank*) without losing their place, with an option to expand into the full chat view."
