    thinking: "**Analyzing App Features**\n\nI\'m currently examining the existing features of the Opportunities section. It seems the `OpportunitiesPage` is primarily focused on tracking applications. The user wants to expand this functionality to include internships and job opportunities sourced from web searches, specifically based on skills. This enhancement is the central focus of my current analysis.\n\n\n**Designing the Hub**\n\nI\'m now focused on designing a comprehensive \"Opportunities Hub\" within the existing section. This involves structuring the UI for an improved experience. A major component will be a live web search engine, dynamically querying internships and jobs based on user skills, location, and career preferences. The \"Live Discovery\" view will support skill filters, type filters (internships, jobs, etc.), and mode filters (remote, in-office).\n\n\n"
