  planner_response {
    response: "I have added **Web-Grounded Internship & Job Discovery** directly into the Opportunities section:\n\n### What Was Built:\n\n1. **Skill-Grounded Web Discovery Hub**:\n   - **Real-Time Skill Matching**: Queries live tech internships, full-time engineering positions, and research fellowships grounded on the student\'s active technical skills (*Python, Machine Learning, SQL, React, TypeScript, Cloud/DevOps, etc.*).\n   - **Interactive Skill Pills & Query Filters**: Students can click on skill chips to instantly toggle them on/off, add custom skills, or type custom role keywords (*e.g., \"AI Research Intern\", \"Frontend Engineer\"*) with instant re-grounding.\n   - **Work Mode & Location Filters**: Filter by *Remote / Hybrid*, *All Locations*, *Hyderabad*, *Bengaluru*, *Pune*, or *Delhi NCR*.\n\n2. **Skill Alignment & Fit Scoring on Cards**:\n   - **Dynamic Match Percentage**: Computes an alignment score (e.g., 95% Match) comparing job requirements to the student\'s skillset.\n   - **Matching vs. Missing Skills**: Visually highlights skills the student already has with green check badges, alongside missing requirement tags to pinpoint skill gaps.\n   - **AI Fit Rationale**: Provides context on why each role matches the candidate\'s career trajectory.\n\n3. **1-Click Application Workflow & Tracker Sync**:\n   - **Direct Official Portal Access**: Direct links out to official company careers portals and research admissions pages.\n   - **Instant Save & Tracker Synchronization**: Students can bookmark discovered jobs with one click to immediately sync them into the **My Tracker** tab to manage pipeline stages (*Saved, Applied, Interviewing, Offer Extended, Archived*)."
    modified_response: "I have added **Web-Grounded Internship & Job Discovery** directly into the Opportunities section:\n\n### What Was Built:\n\n1. **Skill-Grounded Web Discovery Hub**:\n   - **Real-Time Skill Matching**: Queries live tech internships, full-time engineering positions, and research fellowships grounded on the student\'s active technical skills (*Python, Machine Learning, SQL, React, TypeScript, Cloud/DevOps, etc.*).\n   - **Interactive Skill Pills & Query Filters**: Students can click on skill chips to instantly toggle them on/off, add custom skills, or type custom role keywords (*e.g., \"AI Research Intern\", \"Frontend Engineer\"*) with instant re-grounding.\n   - **Work Mode & Location Filters**: Filter by *Remote / Hybrid*, *All Locations*, *Hyderabad*, *Bengaluru*, *Pune*, or *Delhi NCR*.\n\n2. **Skill Alignment & Fit Scoring on Cards**:\n   - **Dynamic Match Percentage**: Computes an alignment score (e.g., 95% Match) comparing job requirements to the student\'s skillset.\n   - **Matching vs. Missing Skills**: Visually highlights skills the student already has with green check badges, alongside missing requirement tags to pinpoint skill gaps.\n   - **AI Fit Rationale**: Provides context on why each role matches the candidate\'s career trajectory.\n\n3. **1-Click Application Workflow & Tracker Sync**:\n   - **Direct Official Portal Access**: Direct links out to official company careers portals and research admissions pages.\n   - **Instant Save & Tracker Synchronization**: Students can bookmark discovered jobs with one click to immediately sync them into the **My Tracker** tab to manage pipeline stages (*Saved, Applied, Interviewing, Offer Extended, Archived*)."
