    response: "I have added the **Daily Tech & AI Internship Trends** section to the Dashboard, grounded in Google Search and tailored to inform students on real-time market shifts and hiring waves:\n\n### What Was Built:\n\n1. **Google Search Grounded Industry Trends (`/api/trends/daily`)**:\n   - Integrated Gemini with Google Search Grounding to identify active 2026 tech hiring patterns, emerging AI paradigms (*Agentic AI, Model Context Protocol, Small Language Models, On-Device WebGPU*), and hot framework demands across top software engineering companies.\n   - Built a robust multi-tier fallback mechanism ensuring smooth operation across all network and quota states.\n\n2. **Daily Tech & AI Trends Dashboard Component**:\n   - **Market Pulse Summary Banner**: Displays a live executive overview of current internship and tech hiring climates, tagged with a *Google Search Grounded* badge and *Summer 2026 Hiring Cycle* metadata.\n   - **Category Filters**: Instant filtering by *All Signals*, *AI & ML*, *Internships & Hiring*, *Cloud & DevOps*, *Software Eng*, and *Open Source & Evals*.\n   - **Trend Intelligence Cards**:\n     - **Growth Signals**: Quantitative indicators (e.g. `+84% Hiring Demand`, `Top Recruiter Priority`).\n     - **Student Strategy Takeaways**: Clear advice on how candidates can position themselves for technical interviews.\n     - **Resume Project Blueprints**: Concrete project ideas to build portfolio credibility.\n     - **1-Click Skill Adoption**: Interactive skill chips allowing students to instantly add trending skills into their profile with real-time feedback.\n     - **Interactive Actions**: Direct links out to official documentation/sources and instant navigation into **Agent Nova** to ask deep-dive follow-up questions."
