  planner_response {
    response: "### Implementation Summary\n\nI have extended and enhanced the existing **NovaPath** application to integrate **Firebase Authentication**, **Cloud Firestore persistent storage**, and **Gemini API** multi-step reasoning, strictly adhering to the system architecture and hackathon requirements:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Files Added and Modified\n\n- **`src/firebase/config.ts`**: Initializes the Firebase Web SDK app, Auth, and Cloud Firestore using `firebase-applet-config.json`.\n- **`src/firebase/auth.ts`**: Implements Google Sign-In with popup, Email/Password sign-in & sign-up, sign-out, and auth state subscription (`onAuthStateChanged`).\n- **`src/firebase/firestore.ts`**: Exports Firestore client instances.\n- **`src/services/profileService.ts`**: Modular service for `getUserProfile()` and `updateUserProfile()` reading/writing to `users/{userId}/profile/data`.\n- **`src/services/memoryService.ts`**: Modular service for `getMemories()`, `saveMemory()`, `updateMemory()`, and `deleteMemory()` for `users/{userId}/memories/{memoryId}`.\n- **`src/services/opportunityService.ts`**: Modular service for `getOpportunities()`, `getSavedOpportunities()`, `saveOpportunity()`, `updateSavedOpportunityStatus()`, and `removeSavedOpportunity()` for `users/{userId}/savedOpportunities/{opportunityId}`.\n- **`src/services/agentRunService.ts`**: Modular service for `saveAgentRun()`, `getAgentRuns()`, and `getAgentRunById()` for `users/{userId}/agentRuns/{runId}`.\n- **`src/components/AuthModal.tsx`**: Clean, accessible login and signup experience with Google Sign-In, Email/Password auth, and visual feature highlights.\n- **`src/components/Navbar.tsx`**: Integrated sign-out button, user profile info pill, and responsive navigation.\n- **`src/App.tsx`**: Connected Firebase Auth state listener, protected view state, Firestore-backed data pipelines, and real-time execution synchronization.\n- **`firestore.rules`**: Production security rules enforcing strict user isolation.\n- **`README.md`**: Comprehensive documentation covering architecture, database schema, workflow steps, security rules, and local development.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Firebase Services & Architecture\n\n- **Firebase Authentication**:\n  - Primary method: **Google Sign-In**\n  - Secondary method: **Email / Password** (Sign up & Sign in)\n  - Full session persistence across browser refreshes and tab re-openings.\n- **Cloud Firestore**:\n  - Database provisioned and mapped cleanly across modular services.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Firestore Collections Schema\n\n1. **`users/{userId}/profile/data`**: Stores student name, email, degree, branch, year, location, skills, career interests, preferred opportunity types, and remote preferences.\n2. **`users/{userId}/memories/{memoryId}`**: Persistent memory bank storing user preferences (e.g., *\"Student prefers Hyderabad and remote AI/ML internships\"*), importance rankings, and categories.\n3. **`users/{userId}/agentRuns/{runId}`**: Multi-step agent execution runs, complete step breakdown, timestamps, identified skill gaps, and generated action plans.\n4. **`users/{userId}/savedOpportunities/{opportunityId}`**: User-bookmarked opportunities, status tracking (`SAVED`, `APPLIED`, `INTERVIEWING`, `OFFER`), and notes.\n5. **`opportunities/{opportunityId}`**: Global index of verified and discovered opportunities.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Gemini API & Deterministic Division of Responsibility\n\n- **Deterministic Layer**:\n  - Profile retrieval & persistence (Firestore)\n  - Memory persistence & recall (Firestore)\n  - 5-factor mathematical match scoring (Skills: 40%, Eligibility: 25%, Location: 15%, Remote: 10%, Experience: 10%)\n  - Opportunity filtering and status transitions\n- **Gemini AI Layer**:\n  - Natural language goal comprehension and intent extraction\n  - Task decomposition into multi-step execution plans\n  - Dynamic skill gap analysis and personalized mini-project recommendations\n  - Search grounding for real-time internship discoveries and daily trends\n  - Interactive Agent Nova career guidance\n\n---\n\n### 5. Environment Variables & Security Rules\n\n- **Environment Variables**: Documented in `.env.example`:\n  - `GEMINI_API_KEY`: Server-side secret used by the Express backend (`server.ts`).\n  - `APP_URL`: Cloud Run hosting origin.\n- **Security Rules (`firestore.rules`)**:\n  - Deployed to Firestore.\n  - Enforces `request.auth.uid == userId` for all subcollections so users can only read and write their own data.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Verification Performed\n\n- **Linter**: `npm run lint` (`tsc --noEmit`) passed with 0 errors.\n- **Compilation**: `compile_applet` passed and produced production static build assets.\n- **Dev Server**: Express + Vite server restarted cleanly on port 3000."
    modified_response: "### Implementation Summary\n\nI have extended and enhanced the existing **NovaPath** application to integrate **Firebase Authentication**, **Cloud Firestore persistent storage**, and **Gemini API** multi-step reasoning, strictly adhering to the system architecture and hackathon requirements:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Files Added and Modified\n\n- **`src/firebase/config.ts`**: Initializes the Firebase Web SDK app, Auth, and Cloud Firestore using `firebase-applet-config.json`.\n- **`src/firebase/auth.ts`**: Implements Google Sign-In with popup, Email/Password sign-in & sign-up, sign-out, and auth state subscription (`onAuthStateChanged`).\n- **`src/firebase/firestore.ts`**: Exports Firestore client instances.\n- **`src/services/profileService.ts`**: Modular service for `getUserProfile()` and `updateUserProfile()` reading/writing to `users/{userId}/profile/data`.\n- **`src/services/memoryService.ts`**: Modular service for `getMemories()`, `saveMemory()`, `updateMemory()`, and `deleteMemory()` for `users/{userId}/memories/{memoryId}`.\n- **`src/services/opportunityService.ts`**: Modular service for `getOpportunities()`, `getSavedOpportunities()`, `saveOpportunity()`, `updateSavedOpportunityStatus()`, and `removeSavedOpportunity()` for `users/{userId}/savedOpportunities/{opportunityId}`.\n- **`src/services/agentRunService.ts`**: Modular service for `saveAgentRun()`, `getAgentRuns()`, and `getAgentRunById()` for `users/{userId}/agentRuns/{runId}`.\n- **`src/components/AuthModal.tsx`**: Clean, accessible login and signup experience with Google Sign-In, Email/Password auth, and visual feature highlights.\n- **`src/components/Navbar.tsx`**: Integrated sign-out button, user profile info pill, and responsive navigation.\n- **`src/App.tsx`**: Connected Firebase Auth state listener, protected view state, Firestore-backed data pipelines, and real-time execution synchronization.\n- **`firestore.rules`**: Production security rules enforcing strict user isolation.\n- **`README.md`**: Comprehensive documentation covering architecture, database schema, workflow steps, security rules, and local development.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Firebase Services & Architecture\n\n- **Firebase Authentication**:\n  - Primary method: **Google Sign-In**\n  - Secondary method: **Email / Password** (Sign up & Sign in)\n  - Full session persistence across browser refreshes and tab re-openings.\n- **Cloud Firestore**:\n  - Database provisioned and mapped cleanly across modular services.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Firestore Collections Schema\n\n1. **`users/{userId}/profile/data`**: Stores student name, email, degree, branch, year, location, skills, career interests, preferred opportunity types, and remote preferences.\n2. **`users/{userId}/memories/{memoryId}`**: Persistent memory bank storing user preferences (e.g., *\"Student prefers Hyderabad and remote AI/ML internships\"*), importance rankings, and categories.\n3. **`users/{userId}/agentRuns/{runId}`**: Multi-step agent execution runs, complete step breakdown, timestamps, identified skill gaps, and generated action plans.\n4. **`users/{userId}/savedOpportunities/{opportunityId}`**: User-bookmarked opportunities, status tracking (`SAVED`, `APPLIED`, `INTERVIEWING`, `OFFER`), and notes.\n5. **`opportunities/{opportunityId}`**: Global index of verified and discovered opportunities.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Gemini API & Deterministic Division of Responsibility\n\n- **Deterministic Layer**:\n  - Profile retrieval & persistence (Firestore)\n  - Memory persistence & recall (Firestore)\n  - 5-factor mathematical match scoring (Skills: 40%, Eligibility: 25%, Location: 15%, Remote: 10%, Experience: 10%)\n  - Opportunity filtering and status transitions\n- **Gemini AI Layer**:\n  - Natural language goal comprehension and intent extraction\n  - Task decomposition into multi-step execution plans\n  - Dynamic skill gap analysis and personalized mini-project recommendations\n  - Search grounding for real-time internship discoveries and daily trends\n  - Interactive Agent Nova career guidance\n\n---\n\n### 5. Environment Variables & Security Rules\n\n- **Environment Variables**: Documented in `.env.example`:\n  - `GEMINI_API_KEY`: Server-side secret used by the Express backend (`server.ts`).\n  - `APP_URL`: Cloud Run hosting origin.\n- **Security Rules (`firestore.rules`)**:\n  - Deployed to Firestore.\n  - Enforces `request.auth.uid == userId` for all subcollections so users can only read and write their own data.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Verification Performed\n\n- **Linter**: `npm run lint` (`tsc --noEmit`) passed with 0 errors.\n- **Compilation**: `compile_applet` passed and produced production static build assets.\n- **Dev Server**: Express + Vite server restarted cleanly on port 3000."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
