  planner_response {
    response: "I have resolved the issue so you can now sign in and create an account with **Username & Password** or **Email & Password**:\n\n### Summary of Changes & Fixes\n\n1. **Username & Email Input Support**:\n   - Replaced the strict email-only input constraint with a versatile **Username or Email Address** field (`type=\"text\"`), allowing direct entry of usernames (e.g., `manoj`, `rahul`, `student`) or standard email addresses without browser validation blocks.\n   - Added automated username normalization (`username` $\\rightarrow$ `username@novapath.edu`) for backend compatibility.\n\n2. **Sign In & Account Creation (Sign Up)**:\n   - Added clear **Sign In** and **Create Account** mode tabs on the authentication card.\n   - Implemented an accounts store and session synchronizer in `src/firebase/auth.ts` so users who sign up or log in with custom usernames/passwords are remembered and immediately authenticated.\n\n3. **Instant Auth State Transition**:\n   - Updated `onSuccess` in `src/App.tsx` and `AuthModal.tsx` to immediately set the active user and load their Firestore profile, memories, and saved opportunities upon form submission.\n   - Connected instant subscriber listeners across all tabs and components.\n\n4. **Multi-Method Login Options**:\n   - **Username / Email & Password**: Primary direct sign-in & registration.\n   - **Continue with Google**: One-click Google popup authentication.\n   - **Instant Student Demo Mode**: One-click instant entry preloaded with Rahul Sharma (B.Tech AI/ML)."
    modified_response: "I have resolved the issue so you can now sign in and create an account with **Username & Password** or **Email & Password**:\n\n### Summary of Changes & Fixes\n\n1. **Username & Email Input Support**:\n   - Replaced the strict email-only input constraint with a versatile **Username or Email Address** field (`type=\"text\"`), allowing direct entry of usernames (e.g., `manoj`, `rahul`, `student`) or standard email addresses without browser validation blocks.\n   - Added automated username normalization (`username` $\\rightarrow$ `username@novapath.edu`) for backend compatibility.\n\n2. **Sign In & Account Creation (Sign Up)**:\n   - Added clear **Sign In** and **Create Account** mode tabs on the authentication card.\n   - Implemented an accounts store and session synchronizer in `src/firebase/auth.ts` so users who sign up or log in with custom usernames/passwords are remembered and immediately authenticated.\n\n3. **Instant Auth State Transition**:\n   - Updated `onSuccess` in `src/App.tsx` and `AuthModal.tsx` to immediately set the active user and load their Firestore profile, memories, and saved opportunities upon form submission.\n   - Connected instant subscriber listeners across all tabs and components.\n\n4. **Multi-Method Login Options**:\n   - **Username / Email & Password**: Primary direct sign-in & registration.\n   - **Continue with Google**: One-click Google popup authentication.\n   - **Instant Student Demo Mode**: One-click instant entry preloaded with Rahul Sharma (B.Tech AI/ML)."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
