    response: "The **ATS Resume Scanner** has been implemented in NovaPath, reusing the existing server-side Gemini integration, Express backend, and Firebase Authentication/Firestore architecture without exposing API keys or altering existing Agent Nova workflows.\n\n### Summary of Implementation\n\n- **Navigation & User Interface**:\n  - Added the **ATS Scanner** section to the primary navigation bar with responsive mobile and desktop support.\n  - Added an **ATS Readiness Spotlight** card on the main Agent Hub dashboard for quick access.\n  - Implemented `AtsDropzone` supporting drag-and-drop file selection for PDF, DOCX, PNG, and JPG formats (up to 10MB) with type validation.\n  - Added an optional **Target Job Description** input to calculate tailored keyword overlap and job-matching scores.\n\n- **Deterministic Scoring & Multi-Pillar Analysis**:\n  - Built a 100-point deterministic rubric auditing 6 core ATS dimensions:\n    - **Keyword Relevance** (25 Points)\n    - **Resume Structure** (20 Points)\n    - **Experience Quality & Action Verbs** (20 Points)\n    - **Skills Alignment** (15 Points)\n    - **ATS Readability & Parsing** (10 Points)\n    - **Contact Information** (10 Points)\n  - Color-coded score indicators (**Green \342\211\24580**, **Amber 60\342\200\22379**, **Red <60**) with clear categorization of High, Medium, and Low severity issues.\n\n- **Detailed ATS Audit Views**:\n  - **Prioritized Strategic Recommendations**: High-impact, numbered action items for resume optimization.\n  - **Formatting & Content Issues Breakdown**: Clear explanations of the detected problem, why it impacts ATS parsing, and specific remediation advice.\n  - **Keyword Analysis**: Visual badges for matched core technical skills alongside suggested missing industry keywords.\n  - **Actionable Bullet Rewrites**: Real sentence rewrites enhancing active impact verbs and measurable results without hallucinating facts.\n  - **Parsed Resume Inspector**: Structured breakdown of contact data, education, technical skills, work history, and projects.\n\n- **Persistence & Cloud Security**:\n  - Integrated Firebase Storage uploads for resume documents (`resumes/{userId}/{resumeId}/{fileName}`).\n  - Structured Firestore persistence (`users/{userId}/atsReports/{reportId}`) and synced local store for full session history, print-ready reports, and deletion management.\n  - `firestore.rules` updated to enforce secure user-scoped access control."
