own of contact data, education, technical skills, work history, and projects.\n\n- **Persistence & Cloud Security**:\n  - Integrated Firebase Storage uploads for resume documents (`resumes/{userId}/{resumeId}/{fileName}`).\n  - Structured Firestore persistence (`users/{userId}/atsReports/{reportId}`) and synced local store for full session history, print-ready reports, and deletion management.\n  - `firestore.rules` updated to enforce secure user-scoped access control."
