    thinking: "**Developing Tab Navigation**\n\nI\'m currently focused on enhancing the component with a new primary tab. I\'ve decided on the tab name and am now exploring badge or icon options to make it more visually engaging. The goal is to improve navigation with a \'Role Selection Blueprint & Changes\' tab.\n\n\n**Refining New Tab Content**\n\nI\'ve been working on the details for the `Overview` and new `roleBlueprint` tabs. The `Overview` will have a prominent callout card for Role Selection Modifications. Within the `roleBlueprint` tab, I\'m structuring sections for target role alignment, executive summaries with copyable options, key skills, project re-framing suggestions, and experience/bullet modifications along with strategic interview talking points.\n\n\n**Implementing Interactive Checklist**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing the implementation of an interactive checklist for role submissions, including a progress indicator for the student. I\'m importing icons like `Copy`, `Check`, `Sparkles`, and more from `lucide-react`. I\'m also considering additional state variables like `copiedSummary`, `copiedHeadline`, and `checkedTasks` to enhance the user experience. I\'m ready to start editing `src/components/ats/AtsReportDetail.tsx`!\n\n\n"
