  planner_response {
    response: "I have added the **Role Selection Blueprint & Strategic Modifications** feature to the ATS Resume Scanner:\n\n### What Has Been Implemented:\n\n- **Target Role Selection Profile & Readiness**:\n  - Automatically assesses selection likelihood (**High**, **Moderate**, or **Needs Tailoring**) for the chosen job role or description.\n  - Highlights whether the resume is currently ready for recruiter review or requires targeted adjustments.\n\n- **Role-Optimized Resume Headline & Executive Summary**:\n  - Provides a single-line professional headline and a tailored 2\342\200\2233 sentence executive summary aligned with the target role.\n  - Includes instant one-click copy buttons to clipboard.\n\n- **Priority Skills to Elevate**:\n  - Identifies the highest-priority technical skills and frameworks that should appear at the top of your technical competencies section for ATS indexing.\n\n- **Project Reframing & Role Angles**:\n  - Compares your current/generic project phrasing with a recommended role-specific narrative angle, highlighting the exact architectural focus and technologies hiring managers look for.\n\n- **Experience Bullet Modifications**:\n  - Outlines phrasing shifts and provides sample role-aligned bullet points utilizing strong action verbs.\n\n- **Interview Preparation & Technical Talking Points**:\n  - Generates targeted technical discussion topics and architectural patterns to prepare for interviews.\n\n- **Pre-Flight Application Checklist & Plan Export**:\n  - Features an interactive checklist to mark off modifications as you edit your resume, alongside an **Export Action Plan** button to copy the entire blueprint in formatted Markdown."
    modified_response: "I have added the **Role Selection Blueprint & Strategic Modifications** feature to the ATS Resume Scanner:\n\n### What Has Been Implemented:\n\n- **Target Role Selection Profile & Readiness**:\n  - Automatically assesses selection likelihood (**High**, **Moderate**, or **Needs Tailoring**) for the chosen job role or description.\n  - Highlights whether the resume is currently ready for recruiter review or requires targeted adjustments.\n\n- **Role-Optimized Resume Headline & Executive Summary**:\n  - Provides a single-line professional headline and a tailored 2\342\200\2233 sentence executive summary aligned with the target role.\n  - Includes instant one-click copy buttons to clipboard.\n\n- **Priority Skills to Elevate**:\n  - Identifies the highest-priority technical skills and frameworks that should appear at the top of your technical competencies section for ATS indexing.\n\n- **Project Reframing & Role Angles**:\n  - Compares your current/generic project phrasing with a recommended role-specific narrative angle, highlighting the exact architectural focus and technologies hiring managers look for.\n\n- **Experience Bullet Modifications**:\n  - Outlines phrasing shifts and provides sample role-aligned bullet points utilizing strong action verbs.\n\n- **Interview Preparation & Technical Talking Points**:\n  - Generates targeted technical discussion topics and architectural patterns to prepare for interviews.\n\n- **Pre-Flight Application Checklist & Plan Export**:\n  - Features an interactive checklist to mark off modifications as you edit your resume, alongside an **Export Action Plan** button to copy the entire blueprint in formatted Markdown."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
