  planner_response {
    response: "I have implemented the **Personalized Career Path** feature into NovaPath while preserving all existing architecture, database schemas, and AI integrations:\n\n### \360\237\214\237 Key Enhancements\n\n- **Personalized Career Path Studio**:\n  - **Dynamic Roadmap Generator**: Synthesizes a structured 4-phase career execution roadmap tailored to the student\'s profile, verified skills, target role, and past ATS analysis using server-side Gemini AI.\n  - **Deterministic 100-Point Readiness Engine**: Evaluates readiness across 6 transparent categories (Required Skills, Practical Projects, Preferred Skills, Tools & Technologies, Education, and Profile Completeness) with live mathematical recalculation as milestones are completed.\n  - **Actionable Milestone Tracker**: Interactive milestone steps with duration estimates, skill requirements, proof-of-work deliverables, and verified documentation/tutorial links.\n  - **Next Recommended Action Banner**: Highlights the immediate milestone or project to tackle next with one-click progress advancement.\n  - **Agent Nova Deep-Integration**: One-click consultation with Agent Nova for step-by-step guidance on any milestone, coding blueprint, or interview concept.\n\n- **Unified Navigation & Cross-Section Triggers**:\n  - Added **Career Path** tab in the main navigation bar with active route highlighting.\n  - Added **Career Path** action buttons on opportunity cards across the Opportunity Tracker and Discovery search results.\n  - Added spotlight exploration cards on the Dashboard to transition between discovery, ATS resume scanning, and career path execution."
    modified_response: "I have implemented the **Personalized Career Path** feature into NovaPath while preserving all existing architecture, database schemas, and AI integrations:\n\n### \360\237\214\237 Key Enhancements\n\n- **Personalized Career Path Studio**:\n  - **Dynamic Roadmap Generator**: Synthesizes a structured 4-phase career execution roadmap tailored to the student\'s profile, verified skills, target role, and past ATS analysis using server-side Gemini AI.\n  - **Deterministic 100-Point Readiness Engine**: Evaluates readiness across 6 transparent categories (Required Skills, Practical Projects, Preferred Skills, Tools & Technologies, Education, and Profile Completeness) with live mathematical recalculation as milestones are completed.\n  - **Actionable Milestone Tracker**: Interactive milestone steps with duration estimates, skill requirements, proof-of-work deliverables, and verified documentation/tutorial links.\n  - **Next Recommended Action Banner**: Highlights the immediate milestone or project to tackle next with one-click progress advancement.\n  - **Agent Nova Deep-Integration**: One-click consultation with Agent Nova for step-by-step guidance on any milestone, coding blueprint, or interview concept.\n\n- **Unified Navigation & Cross-Section Triggers**:\n  - Added **Career Path** tab in the main navigation bar with active route highlighting.\n  - Added **Career Path** action buttons on opportunity cards across the Opportunity Tracker and Discovery search results.\n  - Added spotlight exploration cards on the Dashboard to transition between discovery, ATS resume scanning, and career path execution."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
